    "id": "RNT-LTC_TEC-01",
    "title": "Balfour Beatty - Roads North of the Thames-LTC - Technology Disconnections and Street Lighting Diversions",
    "description": "We are inviting expressions of interest from experienced suppliers for Technology Disconnections and Street Lighting Diversions on the Lower Thames Crossing Roads North programme. The works support the Roads North Temporary Diversions (RNoT), including the A13 and M25 temporary diversion routes.\r\n\r\nPackage Scope\r\n The package includes, but is not limited to:\r\nTechnology disconnections, diversions and alteration works on the M25.\r\nStreet lighting diversions and alterations on the M25, A13, A1089 and associated side roads.\r\nDisconnection, relocation, modification and reconnection of street lighting and technology assets.\r\nAlterations to lighting feeder pillars, electrical supplies, cabling and associated infrastructure.\r\nAlterations and diversions to technology electrical infrastructure (EI).\r\nInstallation, relocation or replacement of lighting columns, luminaires, cabling and equipment.\r\nTesting, inspection, commissioning and certification of completed works.\r\nManaging temporary and permanent arrangements to maintain safe operation of affected systems.\r\nProducing test certification, commissioning records and as-built information.\r\nCoordinating with the Contractor, Design Team and st",
